Use tabs only, now that space indentation is no longer used in XML codeblocks:

```suggestion
				func _ready():
					var tween = create_tween()
					# The property and starting and finishing values are provided with bind(), while "from" and "to" are always 0 and 1.
					tween.tween_method(tween_curve.bind("position", Vector2(0, 100), Vector2(1000, 100)), 0.0, 1.0, 5.0)

				func tween_curve(value, property, from, to):
					set(property, lerp(from, to, curve.sample_baked(value)))
